        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>三、函数</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #1a4fd6;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 705px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 3px solid #1a4fd6;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 30px 28px 40px 28px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .watermark-tr, .watermark-bl {\n    position: absolute;\n    color: #cfd8ef;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  .watermark-tr { top: 22px; right: 20px; }\n  .watermark-bl { bottom: 24px; left: 12px; }\n  .watermark-center {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 300px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 78px;\n    color: #dbe4f7;\n    letter-spacing: 8px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  p.para {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .indent { text-indent: 0; }\n  table.main {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  table.main td {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    padding: 3px 4px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .c { text-align: center; }\n  .b { font-weight: bold; }\n  .rowlabel { text-align: center; width: 46px; }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .sec {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    margin: 10px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .sub {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    margin: 8px 0 4px 0;\n    padding-left: 96px;\n  }\n  table.power {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 190px;\n  }\n  table.power td {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    padding: 2px 3px;\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  table.power td.vlabel {\n    width: 14px;\n    font-size: 6px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .vtext {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: upright;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .flowbox {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 66px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"watermark-tr\">@哈喽高职生</div>\n  <div class=\"watermark-bl\">@哈喽高职生</div>\n  <div class=\"watermark-center\">高职生</div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">三、函数</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"para\">1.概念：A、B为两个非空实数集，对于集合A中任意元素，在集合B中都有唯一确定的数值与之对应，就称f(x) 是A到B的函数。</p>\n  <p class=\"para\">2.性质：</p>\n\n  <table class=\"main\">\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"rowlabel b\">定义域</td>\n      <td class=\"c\">一次函数、二次函数,x∈R</td>\n      <td class=\"c\">反比例函数x≠0</td>\n      <td class=\"c\">对数函数x &gt; 0</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"rowlabel b\" rowspan=\"2\">值域</td>\n      <td class=\"c\"><span class=\"b\">一次函数：</span>y=kx+b(k≠0)<br><span class=\"b\">y∈R</span></td>\n      <td class=\"c\"><span class=\"b\">反比例函数：</span>y=$\\frac{k}{x}$(k≠0)<br>y ∈（-∞, 0）∪（0，+∞）</td>\n      <td class=\"c\"><span class=\"b\">二次函数：</span>y=ax<sup>2</sup><br>+bx+c(a,b,c为常数且a≠0)<br><span class=\"b\">y看开口方向和对称性</span></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"c\"><span class=\"b\">指数函数：</span>y=a<sup>x</sup>（a&gt;0且a≠1）<br>y∈（0，+∞）</td>\n      <td class=\"c\" colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"b\">对数函数</span>log<sub>a</sub> x（a&gt;0且a≠1）<br>y∈R</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"rowlabel b\">单调性</td>\n      <td class=\"c\" colspan=\"3\">\n        $x_1$ &lt;$x_2$ &nbsp; f($x_1$) &lt; f($x_2$) ⟺ f (x) 是增函数 &nbsp;&nbsp; $\\frac{f(x_1)-f(x_2)}{x_1-x_2}$&gt;0⟺f (x) 是增函数<br>\n        $x_1$ &lt;$x_2$ &nbsp; f($x_1$) &gt; f($x_2$) ⟺ f (x) 是减函数 &nbsp;&nbsp; $\\frac{f(x_1)-f(x_2)}{x_1-x_2}$&lt;0⟺f (x) 是减函数<br>\n        复合函数y=f（g（x）） 同增异减\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"rowlabel b\">奇偶性</td>\n      <td class=\"c\" colspan=\"3\">\n        f（-x）＝f（x）⟺f (x) 是偶函数 ⟺ 图像关于y轴对称，对称轴x=$\\frac{a+b}{2}$<br>\n        f（-x）=-f（x）⟺f (x) 是奇函数 ⟺ 图像关于原点对称，对称中心（$\\frac{a+b}{2}$，0）\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"rowlabel b\">零点</td>\n      <td colspan=\"3\">\n        <div class=\"flowbox\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:220px;height:60px;margin:0 auto;\">[Diagram: 零点关系流程图，居中。含\"函数y=f(x)有零点\"、\"函数y=f(x)的图象与x轴有交点\"、\"方程f(x)=0有实数根\"三个椭圆及连接箭头]</div>\n        </div>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <p class=\"sec\">3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;幂函数</p>\n\n  <p class=\"sub\">3.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;五个幂函数的图象</p>\n  <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:150px;height:82px;margin:6px auto 0 auto;\">[Chart: 居中，五个幂函数 y=x、y=x<sup>2</sup>、y=x<sup>3</sup>、y=x<sup>1/2</sup>、y=x<sup>-1</sup> 的坐标系图象]</div>\n\n  <p class=\"sub\">3.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;五个幂函数的性质</p>\n\n  <table class=\"power\">\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"vlabel\"><div class=\"vtext\">幂函数</div></td>\n      <td>y=x</td>\n      <td>y=x<sup>2</sup></td>\n      <td>y=x<sup>3</sup></td>\n      <td>y=x<sup>$\\frac{1}{2}$</sup></td>\n      <td>y=x<sup>-1</sup></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"vlabel\"><div class=\"vtext\">定义域</div></td>\n      <td><b>R</b></td>\n      <td><b>R</b></td>\n      <td><b>R</b></td>\n      <td>[0，+∞）</td>\n      <td>（-∞,0）∪<br>（0,+∞）</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"vlabel\"><div class=\"vtext\">值域</div></td>\n      <td><b>R</b></td>\n      <td>[0,+∞）</td>\n      <td><b>R</b></td>\n      <td>[0,+∞）</td>\n      <td>（-∞,0）∪<br>（0,+∞）</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"vlabel\"><div class=\"vtext\">奇偶性</div></td>\n      <td>奇</td>\n      <td>偶</td>\n      <td>奇</td>\n      <td>非奇非偶</td>\n      <td>奇</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"vlabel\"><div class=\"vtext\">单调性</div></td>\n      <td>增</td>\n      <td>x∈[0，+∞）<br>增<br>x∈（-∞,0］<br>减</td>\n      <td>增</td>\n      <td>增</td>\n      <td>x∈[0,+∞）<br>减<br>x∈（-∞,0）<br>减</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"vlabel\"><div class=\"vtext\">公共点</div></td>\n      <td colspan=\"5\">（1,1）</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
